    <string name="setup_notifications_body">Notifications can show scan reminders and protection-service status. You can continue without them, but alerts may be limited by Android notification settings.</string>
    <string name="setup_sentinel_title">Background protection</string>
    <string name="setup_sentinel_body">Download Sentinel is optional. When enabled, its foreground service watches APK file changes directly inside the accessible top-level Downloads folder. It cannot intercept every installation or monitor every app-specific folder.</string>
